        teachers/form.html. `code` is the numeric id the form sends and is the
        only field scoring depends on, so a label that needs correcting can be
        fixed in the UI without affecting any stored score.

        VERIFY THE ARABIC LABELS against the real form.html before going live.
        They were recovered from a PDF render that reverses word order in
        right-to-left runs and mangles some hamza forms, so a reconstruction
        error in the display text is possible. The codes and the Latin-script
